Here's an outline of the code structure:

```java
public class ConnectionManager {
    private final Map<Server, ConnectionPool> serverConnectionPools;
    private final LoadBalancer loadBalancer;

    public ConnectionManager(List<Server> servers) {
        this.serverConnectionPools = new HashMap<>();
        this.loadBalancer = new RoundRobinLoadBalancer();

        for (Server server : servers) {
            ConnectionPool connectionPool = new ConnectionPool(server);
            serverConnectionPools.put(server, connectionPool);
        }
    }

    public HttpClient getHttpClient() {
        Server server = loadBalancer.selectNextServer();
        Connection connection = serverConnectionPools.get(server).borrowConnection();
        return HttpClients.custom()
            .setConnectionManager(new PoolingHttpClientConnectionManager(connection))
            .build();
    }

    // Add methods for returning connections to the pool, closing connections, and monitoring performance
}
```

