The implementation also includes an optimized update strategy that can handle large numbers of nested sessions and concurrent updates from multiple users while maintaining good performance and long-term maintainability. It supports both batch and individual update modes for performance testing purposes. The session data persistence strategy is left to be implemented based on specific requirements."]

